  "notes": "Two units share this docket/report; identity.unit set to 1 per docket 05000498 mapping though event affected both Unit 1 (defueled) and Unit 2 (100% power). Root cause (TDSP work practices) and contributing cause (STP oversight) both described in narrative; cause_code A (Personnel Error) governs per Block 13. SFP cooling pump loss and lost indications (ICS, RM-11, RT-8010B) noted as consequences but not modeled as separate FailureMode nodes since they are parallel effects of the same bus de-energization, captured within the consequence node. Previous similar event 2010-004-00 modeled as stub LER per rule 9."
